msgid "Update"
msgstr "Update"

msgid "It is our pleasure to announce the release of Quarkus 3.20, which is our new LTS (Long Term Support) version."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This version is built on the top of Quarkus 3.19 with some additional bugfixes.\n"
"New features landed in https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-21-0-released/[Quarkus 3.21], which was also released today."
msgstr ""

msgid "If you want to know more about our LTS policy, the https://quarkus.io/blog/lts-releases/[LTS announcement] is a must read."
msgstr "LTSポリシーについて詳しく知りたい場合は、 https://quarkus.io/blog/lts-releases/[LTSに関する発表] を必ずお読みください。"

msgid "LTS releases are supported for 12 months."
msgstr "LTSリリースは12ヶ月間サポートされます。"

msgid "If you are coming from the previous LTS, Quarkus 3.15, there are a lot of exciting new features and we recommend reading the following announcements:"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-16-1-released/[Quarkus 3.16 - OpenTelemetry Logging, LGTM Quarkus dashboard and too many things to list here]"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-17-0-released/[Quarkus 3.17 - Observability improvements, programmatic permission checkers, MicroProfile REST Client 4.0]"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-18-1-released/[Quarkus 3.18 - Micrometer for WebSockets Next, Security WebAuthn based on WebAuthn4J, Kubernetes Client 7...]"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-19-1-released/[Quarkus 3.19 - UBI 9 images, Micrometer to OpenTelemetry bridge, JEP 483 new AOT cache...]"
msgstr ""

msgid "To update to Quarkus 3.20, we recommend updating to the latest version of the Quarkus CLI and run:"
msgstr "Quarkus 3.20 に更新するには、Quarkus CLI の最新バージョンに更新し、以下を実行することをお勧めします。"

msgid "Note that `quarkus update` can update your applications from any version of Quarkus (including 2.x) to Quarkus 3.20 LTS."
msgstr ""

msgid "If you are upgrading from 3.19, there's nothing to do as 3.20 is the direct continuation of 3.19."
msgstr ""

msgid "If you are upgrading from the previous LTS, Quarkus 3.15, please refer to the following migration guides:"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.16[Migration guide for 3.16]"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.17[Migration guide for 3.17]"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.18[Migration guide for 3.18]"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.19[Migration guide for 3.19]"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.20[Migration guide for 3.20] - this one is empty as 3.20 is the continuation of 3.19"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Note that `quarkus update` should handle most of the heavy lifting for you,\n"
"but there are still cases that should be handled manually and we recommend reading these migration guides carefully."
msgstr "`quarkus update` コマンドはほとんどの面倒な作業を処理するはずですが、手動で処理する必要があるケースもまだありますので、これらの移行ガイドを注意深く読むことをお勧めします。"

msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr ""

msgid "Platform component upgrades"
msgstr "プラットフォームコンポーネントのアップグレード"

msgid "Camel Quarkus"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Camel Quarkus has been updated to 3.20.0.\n"
"You can find everything you need to know about it in the https://camel.apache.org/releases/q-3.20.0/[release notes]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Quarkus CXF"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Quarkus CXF 3.20 was released and is now available in https://code.quarkus.io/?extension-search=origin:platform%20quarkus-cxf[Quarkus Platform 3.20].\n"
"Check the https://docs.quarkiverse.io/quarkus-cxf/dev/release-notes/3.20.0.html[Quarkus CXF 3.20.0] release notes for more information about what is new in this release."
msgstr ""

msgid "Amazon Services"
msgstr ""

msgid "The Amazon Services extensions have been upgraded to version 3.3.1."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr "完全な変更履歴"

msgid "The core part of Quarkus 3.20.0 is a rebadged release of Quarkus 3.19.4 so nothing new here."
msgstr ""

msgid "Contributors"
msgstr "コントリビューター"

msgid ""
"The Quarkus community is growing and has now https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/graphs/contributors[1068 contributors].\n"
"Many many thanks to each and everyone of them."
msgstr ""

msgid "In particular for the 3.20 release, thanks to Ales Justin, Alexey Loubyansky, Andreas Maechler, Andy Damevin, Auri Munoz, brunobat, Clement Escoffier, cmoulliard, David Cotton, Dennis Kronbügel, Fabian, Foivos Zakkak, Georg Leber, George Gastaldi, Georgios Andrianakis, Guillaume Smet, Jakub Jedlicka, Jan Martiska, jcjveraa, Karm Michal Babacek, Katia Aresti, Ladislav Thon, Marco Belladelli, Martin Kouba, Martin Panzer, masecla22, Maximilian Zellhofer, melloware, Michal Maléř, Michal Vavřík, Ozan Gunalp, Peter Palaga, Phillip Kruger, Robert Stupp, Roberto Cortez, Rolfe Dlugy-Hegwer, Ryan Dens, Rüdiger zu Dohna, Sergey Beryozkin, shjones, Stephan Strate, Steve Hawkins, Stuart Douglas, Thomas Canava, w0pp, Welton Rodrigo Torres Nascimento, Willem Jan Glerum, xstefank, and Yoshikazu Nojima."
msgstr ""

msgid "The list is a bit smaller than usual as 3.20 only contains bugfixes on top of 3.19."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr "参加のお誘い"

msgid "We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... Let's build something great together!"
msgstr "私達は皆様からのフィードバックに重きを置いています。バグ報告、改善要望を是非お願いします。一緒に素晴らしいものを作り上げていきましょう!"

msgid "If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our welcoming community:"
msgstr "Quarkusユーザーの場合でも、単に興味を持っているだけの場合でも、恥ずかしがらずにコミュニティに参加して下さい!:"

msgid "provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub] でフィードバック"

msgid "craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr "コードを作成し、 https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[プルリクエスト] を送信"

msgid "discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr "https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] や https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[メーリングリスト] でディスカッションに参加"

msgid "ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow] で質問"
